/*! \page module_emscripten Emscripten Rules

The \c emscripten module will automatically detect the appropriate compilers and set up some architecture-specific items.

When building with Emscripten, additional rules are available to complete the build.

\section module_emscripten_ruleslist List of Rules

\secreflist
\refitem rule_C_emscripten_JSLibraries C.emscripten.JSLibraries
\refitem rule_C_emscripten_JSPre C.emscripten.JSPre
\refitem rule_C_emscripten_JSPost C.emscripten.JSPost
\refitem rule_C_emscripten_JSExterns C.emscripten.JSExterns
\endsecreflist

\section module_emscripten_rules Rules

<hr>
\section rule_C_emscripten_JSLibraries rule C.emscripten.JSLibraries TARGET : SOURCES : OPTIONS
\addindex rule_C_emscripten_JSLibraries

For the given \c TARGET, assign libraries via \c SOURCES to be linked with the link flag <tt>--js-library</tt>.

\param TARGET The target to assign the libraries to.  \c TARGET is optional if \ref rule_ActiveTarget has been specified.  If \c TARGET is <tt>*</tt>, the libraries will be linked for all applications.
\param SOURCES The list of libraries.
\param OPTIONS If \c public is specified, the libraries specified by \c SOURCES are made available to a project using \c C.Inherits.

\code
    C.emscripten.JSLibraries :
            js/libs/library_godot_audio.js
            js/libs/library_godot_display.js
            js/libs/library_godot_emscripten.js
            js/libs/library_godot_fetch.js
            js/libs/library_godot_webmidi.js
            js/libs/library_godot_os.js
            js/libs/library_godot_runtime.js
            js/libs/library_godot_input.js
            js/libs/library_godot_webgl2.js
    ;
\endcode




<hr>
\section rule_C_emscripten_JSPre rule C.emscripten.JSPre TARGET : SOURCES : OPTIONS
\addindex rule_C_emscripten_JSPre

For the given \c TARGET, assign libraries via \c SOURCES to be linked with the link flag <tt>--pre-js</tt>.

\param TARGET The target to assign the libraries to.  \c TARGET is optional if \ref rule_ActiveTarget has been specified.  If \c TARGET is <tt>*</tt>, the libraries will be linked for all applications.
\param SOURCES The list of libraries.
\param OPTIONS If \c public is specified, the libraries specified by \c SOURCES are made available to a project using \c C.Inherits.

\code
    C.emscripten.JSPre :
            js/libs/a_pre_file.js
    ;
\endcode





<hr>
\section rule_C_emscripten_JSPost rule C.emscripten.JSPost TARGET : SOURCES : OPTIONS
\addindex rule_C_emscripten_JSPost

For the given \c TARGET, assign libraries via \c SOURCES to be linked with the link flag <tt>--post-js</tt>.

\param TARGET The target to assign the libraries to.  \c TARGET is optional if \ref rule_ActiveTarget has been specified.  If \c TARGET is <tt>*</tt>, the libraries will be linked for all applications.
\param SOURCES The list of libraries.
\param OPTIONS If \c public is specified, the libraries specified by \c SOURCES are made available to a project using \c C.Inherits.

\code
    C.emscripten.JSPost :
            js/patches/patch_em_gl.js
    ;
\endcode






<hr>
\section rule_C_emscripten_JSExterns rule C.emscripten.JSExterns TARGET : SOURCES : OPTIONS
\addindex rule_C_emscripten_JSExterns

For the given \c TARGET, assign libraries via \c SOURCES to be linked with the flag <tt>--externs</tt>.

\param TARGET The target to assign the libraries to.  \c TARGET is optional if \ref rule_ActiveTarget has been specified.  If \c TARGET is <tt>*</tt>, the libraries will be linked for all applications.
\param SOURCES The list of libraries.
\param OPTIONS If \c public is specified, the libraries specified by \c SOURCES are made available to a project using \c C.Inherits.

\code
    C.emscripten.JSExterns :
            js/libs/library_godot_webgl2.externs.js
    ;
\endcode








<hr>
*/

